# ce-register-ipk-handler — webOS CE: make Preware the .ipk handler the
# way Preware itself would, at RUNTIME. A static entry in
# /usr/palm/command-resource-handlers.json is registered non-streamable,
# and the browser only hands a .ipk URL to the handler when canStream is
# true — so a static seed makes browser .ipk links download instead of
# opening Preware, and permanently dedupes the runtime call that would
# have fixed it. See bake.py (b) for the full trace.

start on first-use-finished

console none

script
    exec sh -e /usr/palm/ce-seed/jobs/ce-register-ipk-handler.sh
end script
